          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On August 22, 2010, around 8:00 PM, a witness observed for 5 minutes a round glowing object approaching and then disappearing at an extremely high speed towards the East. The phenomenon reappeared exactly at the same location one minute later and then disappeared very quickly towards the North-West. No other testimony about this phenomenon was collected. The incomplete questionnaire makes this testimony unusable. This case is classified as C due to lack of information.",
